  _legacyAliases:
  - _legacySwatchName: Default
    _legacyColorId: Text
    _canonicalTokenId: text/primary
    _deprecatedSince: 1.18.0
    _removalVersion: 2.0.0
    _note: 63 uses, 55 of them TextMeshPro. The 8 Image uses inherit the text colour
      as a fill; review whether those want surface/wash-subtle instead.
  - _legacySwatchName: Default
    _legacyColorId: Primary
    _canonicalTokenId: action/primary/fill
    _deprecatedSince: 1.18.0
    _removalVersion: 2.0.0
    _note: "26 uses, 23 of them Image. The 3 TextMeshPro uses want text/accent \u2014
      same colour, so rendering is unchanged either way."
  - _legacySwatchName: Default
    _legacyColorId: Secondary
    _canonicalTokenId: surface/panel
    _deprecatedSince: 1.18.0
    _removalVersion: 2.0.0
    _note: 'Its RGB is identical to Default.Background: never a secondary brand colour,
      but the surface base at full alpha.'
  - _legacySwatchName: Default
    _legacyColorId: Accent
    _canonicalTokenId: surface/raised
    _deprecatedSince: 1.18.0
    _removalVersion: 2.0.0
    _note: 9 uses, all Image, and a distinct chrome tone rather than a brand accent.
  - _legacySwatchName: Default
    _legacyColorId: Background
    _canonicalTokenId: surface/canvas
    _deprecatedSince: 1.18.0
    _removalVersion: 2.0.0
    _note: 19 uses, all Image.
  - _legacySwatchName: Default
    _legacyColorId: Disabled
    _canonicalTokenId: action/disabled/fill
    _deprecatedSince: 1.18.0
    _removalVersion: 2.0.0
